00:07:42.595 --> 00:07:43.262
against Donald Trump

00:07:43.262 --> 00:07:45.064
of the many pending investigations.

00:07:45.064 --> 00:07:45.565
This is not

00:07:45.565 --> 00:07:45.798
what's going

00:07:45.798 --> 00:07:47.133
to keep him out of office again.

00:07:47.133 --> 00:07:49.435
How difficult is this case

00:07:49.635 --> 00:07:51.904
to actually put it in front of a jury?

00:07:51.904 --> 00:07:53.473
It's going to be a very challenging case.

00:07:53.473 --> 00:07:53.706
I mean, there are

00:07:53.706 --> 00:07:55.174
a number of legal issues

00:07:55.174 --> 00:07:56.275
that the district attorney's office

00:07:56.275 --> 00:07:57.577
is going to have to overcome

00:07:57.577 --> 00:07:58.711
with respect to the charge

00:07:58.711 --> 00:08:00.413
that it seems that they are contemplating

00:08:00.413 --> 00:08:01.314
related to the campaign

00:08:01.314 --> 00:08:02.849
finance violation, which, of course,

00:08:02.849 --> 00:08:03.216
would be

00:08:03.216 --> 00:08:03.616
a matter

00:08:03.616 --> 00:08:05.551
of federal law incorporated essentially

00:08:05.551 --> 00:08:07.086
into a state prosecution,

00:08:07.086 --> 00:08:08.955
which has not been done.

00:08:08.955 --> 00:08:10.857
This is there's some precedent for it,

00:08:10.857 --> 00:08:12.325
but not that actually been tested

00:08:12.325 --> 00:08:13.292
all the way up through the courts.

00:08:13.292 --> 00:08:13.626
In other words,

00:08:13.626 --> 00:08:15.027
they have been pleased that

00:08:15.027 --> 00:08:16.362
that reflected a similar charge,

00:08:16.362 --> 00:08:18.798
but hasn't really been fully litigated.

00:08:18.798 --> 00:08:20.233
And then as a factual matter,

00:08:20.233 --> 00:08:21.133
they are going to be relying

00:08:21.133 --> 00:08:22.301
on Michael Cohen.

00:08:22.301 --> 00:08:23.569
And he is a problematic witness,

00:08:23.569 --> 00:08:24.904
which is why it is so important

00:08:24.904 --> 00:08:26.005
that he be corroborated

00:08:26.005 --> 00:08:27.874
by other witnesses like David Pecker

00:08:27.874 --> 00:08:29.542
and by the documents in the case

00:08:29.542 --> 00:08:30.643
And also,

00:08:30.643 --> 00:08:31.477
Kellyanne Conway,

00:08:31.477 --> 00:08:32.345
I believe, from the campaign

00:08:32.345 --> 00:08:34.213
also has testified before the grand jury,

00:08:34.213 --> 00:08:35.448
who would be another important witness

00:08:35.448 --> 00:08:37.283
to corroborate that this was coordinated

00:08:37.283 --> 00:08:39.018
with the Trump campaign to scare off.

00:08:39.018 --> 00:08:39.986
Appreciate it was fired.

00:08:39.986 --> 00:08:40.753
Griffin, thanks so much.

